# Session hand-off notes, deliberately NOT part of the package.
# CLAUDE.md carries the working rules for an AI session in this checkout and
# HANDOFF.md carries conclusions already measured, so the next session does not
# re-derive them. Both are local to this machine's workflow, not something a user
# of pxGPT installs or needs. Kept on disk, out of the repo.
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md
